    "Are there any demand limits or minimum production requirements for the three products, or can we produce and sell any non-negative quantity of each product as long as the machine-hour and equipment constraints are satisfied?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks a single clarification question regarding the existence of demand limits or minimum production requirements versus the ability to produce any non-negative quantity."
}

